sections.护栏的局限:
The official cookbook lists three limits, each one critical:
an LLM guardrail shares the base call's vulnerabilities — one injection can evade both at once;
the longer the conversation, the more instructions get diluted, and the easier jailbreaking becomes;
overly strict guardrails over-refuse, misclassifying normal requests as attacks.

Official mitigations: combine with rule-based detection or traditional models;
some guardrails consider only the latest message to avoid long-conversation confusion;
roll out gradually with monitoring, feeding new attack samples back into the guardrails.
